OL,3,GNEWSAMan's body found in burned-out van
OL,4,Aon industrial estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man's body has been found in a
OL,7,Fburned-out van on an industrial estate
OL,8,Fin Renfrewshire.
OL,10,FPolices and fire crews were called to
OL,11,Fthe scene on Brownsfield Road in
OL,12,FInchinnan at about 14:40 on Sunday.
OL,14,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said:
OL,15,F"Emergency services attended and the
OL,16,Ffire was extinguished.
OL,18,F"A body was found within the vehicle
OL,19,Fand inquiries to establish the full
OL,20,Fcircumstances are ongoing."
